  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (8)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (8) is another tiny, thin-flat gasket located at
    the bottom-center-front, similar to Oil Pan Gasket (7), but made of Material.008.
    It works in tandem with other gaskets to maintain a leak-free oil pan. Notably,
    its unique material properties allow it to withstand high temperatures and pressures,
    ensuring a tight seal.
